
                 DayDream BBS V1.00, I/O-Device Structure
                 ----------------------------------------

OFFSET  TYPE     LENGTH  DESCRIPTION                                     FLAGS
==============================================================================
 0000   WORD       02    I/O DEVICE UNIT NUMBER                            (-)
 0002   LONG WORD  04    I/O DEVICE INITIALIZATION BAUD RATE               (-)
 0006   STRING     25    I/O DEVICE NAME                                   (-)
 0032   STRING     15    MODEM PRE-INITIALIZATION STRING                   (-)
 0048   STRING     15    MODEM OFFHOOK STRING                              (-)
 0064   STRING     15    MODEM ANSWER COMMAND STRING                       (-)
 0080   STRING     60    MODEM INITIALIZATION STRING                       (-)
 0141   STRING     15    MODEM "OK" RESPONSE                               (-)
 0157   STRING     15    MODEM "RING" MESSAGE                              (-)
 0173   STRING     15    MODEM "NO CARRIER" RESPONSE                       (-)
 0189   STRING     15    MODEM "CONNECT" RESPONSE                          (-)
 0205   STRING     09    CONNECTION SPEED IDENTIFIER #1                    (-)
 0215   STRING     09    CONNECTION SPEED IDENTIFIER #2                    (-)
 0225   STRING     09    CONNECTION SPEED IDENTIFIER #3                    (-)
 0235   STRING     09    CONNECTION SPEED IDENTIFIER #4                    (-)
 0245   STRING     09    CONNECTION SPEED IDENTIFIER #5                    (-)
 0255   STRING     09    CONNECTION SPEED IDENTIFIER #6                    (-)
 0265   STRING     09    CONNECTION SPEED IDENTIFIER #7                    (-)
 0275   STRING     09    CONNECTION SPEED IDENTIFIER #8                    (-)
 0285   STRING     09    CONNECTION SPEED IDENTIFIER #9                    (-)
 0295   STRING     09    CONNECTION SPEED IDENTIFIER #0                    (-)
 0305   STRING     06    ERROR CORRECTION IDENTIFIER                       (-)
 0312   WORD       02    CONNECTION SPEED #1                               (-)
 0314   WORD       02    CONNECTION SPEED #2                               (-)
 0316   WORD       02    CONNECTION SPEED #3                               (-)
 0318   WORD       02    CONNECTION SPEED #4                               (-)
 0320   WORD       02    CONNECTION SPEED #5                               (-)
 0322   WORD       02    CONNECTION SPEED #6                               (-)
 0324   WORD       02    CONNECTION SPEED #7                               (-)
 0326   WORD       02    CONNECTION SPEED #8                               (-)
 0328   WORD       02    CONNECTION SPEED #9                               (-)
 0330   WORD       02    CONNECTION SPEED #0                               (-)
 0332   BYTE       01    DELAY BETWEEN CONNECTION AND FIRST OUTPUT (SECS)  (-)
 0333   BYTE       01    DELAY BEFORE MODEM INITIALIZATION ATTEMPTS (SECS) (-)
 0334   LONG WORD  04    I/O DEVICE SETUP BITS                             (-)
 0338   FREE BLOCK 62    FREE SPACE FOR FUTURE DEVELOPMENT                 (-)
 0400   END        00    END OF I/O DEVICE DATA FILE STRUCTURE             (-)
==============================================================================

BIT     MEANING WHEN BIT IS SET                          I/O DEVICE SETUP BITS
==============================================================================
000     OPEN I/O DEVICE IN SHARED MORE INSTEAD OF AN EXCLUSIVE USE
 .
 .
031
==============================================================================
